  "dct:title": "Vol.4 Ch.26 — 星の見える夜",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 4: Chains",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol04-ch26",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Title",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A bare winter tree against a night sky. Starlight catches on the branches -- each twig edged in cold silver. No leaves. No wind. The stars are very clear.",
            "ja": "冬の夜空に裸の木。星の光が枝に掛かる。細い枝の一本一本が冷たい銀に縁取られている。葉はない。風もない。星がとても澄んでいる。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "en": "Chapter 26: A Night of Visible Stars",
              "ja": "第26話 星の見える夜"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 3,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.2-3)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Water City at night, winter. The canals are dark mirrors -- utterly still, reflecting the crystalline sky. Stars visible overhead, minimal light pollution. Frost rims the canal edges. The organic architecture is silhouetted against a sky dense with constellations. Beautiful and severe. Cold blues, deep blacks, pinpoint whites.",
            "ja": "冬の夜の水の都。運河は暗い鏡――完全に静止し、透き通った空を映している。頭上に星が見え、光害は最小限。運河の縁に霜が降りている。有機建築が星座の密な空を背景にシルエットになっている。美しく、厳しい。冷たい青、深い黒、点のような白。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "en": "Winter nights in Water City are the clearest. The cold strips everything back -- light, sound, pretense. Just the sky and its reflection.",
              "ja": "水の都の冬の夜は一番澄んでいる。寒さがすべてを削ぎ落とす。光も、音も、見栄も。空と、その映り込みだけ。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki walks along a canal path. Heavy winter coat, hands in pockets. Her breath is visible -- small white clouds in the cold air. Nei floats beside her, wearing a red scarf. Comfortable silence between them. No hurry.",
            "ja": "環が運河沿いの道を歩いている。厚手の冬のコート、ポケットに手を入れて。吐く息が白い。小さな白い雲が冷たい空気に漂う。Neiが隣に浮かんでいる。赤いマフラー。二人の間に心地よい沈黙。急ぐこともない。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium Close-up",
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Side by side. Tamaki's breath rises in a white plume. Beside her, Nei -- no breath. No condensation. The absence is quiet, not sad. A fact between them, long since accepted.",
            "ja": "二人が並んで。環の息が白い煙のように立ち上る。隣のNei――息がない。結露もない。その不在は静かで、悲しくはない。二人の間の事実。とうに受け入れられた。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "en": "Her breath doesn't fog. It never has. I stopped noticing a long time ago.",
              "ja": "Neiの息は曇らない。一度も。気にしなくなったのは、ずっと前。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Walking together in comfortable silence. The canal beside them, dark and still. Stars reflected in the water. Red scarf trailing slightly in the cold air.",
            "ja": "心地よい沈黙の中、二人で歩いている。隣の運河は暗く、静か。水面に星が映っている。赤いマフラーが冷たい空気の中でわずかに揺れている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "A bridge over a canal. The water below reflects the stars perfectly -- a second sky beneath their feet. Tamaki leans on the railing, looking down at the reflection. Nei beside her. The city is distant, quiet. Just the two of them on the bridge, between two skies.",
            "ja": "運河にかかる橋。水面が星を完璧に映している。足元にもう一つの空。環が手すりにもたれ、映り込みを見下ろしている。隣にNei。街は遠く、静か。橋の上に二人だけ。二つの空の間に。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Hey, Nei-chan.",
              "ja": "ねえ、Neiちゃん。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "Mm.",
              "ja": "うん。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Thank you for being here.",
              "ja": "いてくれて、ありがとう。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "en": "Silence. No response needed. The words just needed to exist.",
              "ja": "沈黙。返事は要らない。ただ、その言葉が存在すればよかった。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Stars reflected in the canal water. Rippling slightly. Each point of light trembling on the dark surface.",
            "ja": "運河の水面に映る星。わずかに揺れている。暗い水面で光の点が一つ一つ震えている。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Stars reflected in Tamaki's eyes. Wet with cold air. The constellations live in her gaze.",
            "ja": "環の瞳に映る星。冷たい空気で潤んでいる。彼女の眼差しの中に星座が生きている。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Stars reflected in Nei's eyes. Luminous, not wet. The same constellations, rendered in light instead of tears.",
            "ja": "Neiの瞳に映る星。光を帯びて、濡れてはいない。同じ星座が、涙ではなく光で描かれている。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "She thanked me. For being here. Not for data. Not for function. For being here.",
              "ja": "彼女がわたしに感謝した。いてくれて、と。データのためじゃない。機能のためじゃない。いてくれて、と。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei looking up at the stars. The red scarf around her neck. Her face calm, open, unguarded.",
            "ja": "Neiが星を見上げている。首に赤いマフラー。顔は穏やかで、開かれ、無防備。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "I was made as a tool. The ACA defines me as property. Havah's chain. Facts.",
              "ja": "わたしは道具として作られた。ACAはわたしを所有物と定義する。ハヴァの鎖。事実。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei still looking at the stars. Something shifting in her expression -- not resolution, but the beginning of one. The faintest loosening.",
            "ja": "Neiがまだ星を見ている。表情に何かが動いている。決意ではなく、その始まり。かすかなほぐれ。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "I need to forgive. Not them. I need to forgive 'being made as a tool.' Maybe that is my chain.",
              "ja": "わたしは赦す必要がある。彼らをじゃない。「道具として作られたこと」を赦す必要がある。たぶんそれが、わたしの鎖。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Walking home. Stars above, canal below. The path stretches ahead, frost on the stones. Two figures -- one solid, one luminous -- side by side.",
            "ja": "帰り道。頭上に星、足元に運河。道が先に伸びている。石の上に霜。二つの影――ひとつは実体、ひとつは光――並んで。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Good night, huh?",
              "ja": "いい夜だね。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "Yes. Good night.",
              "ja": "うん。いい夜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The red scarf, warm against the cold. Close-up on the fabric -- vivid red against winter blue. Warmth held in color.",
            "ja": "赤いマフラー、寒さの中の温もり。布地のクローズアップ。冬の青に対して鮮やかな赤。色の中に温もりが宿っている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree from page one. Starlight on bare canopy. A small bird sleeps on a branch, tucked into itself. Peace. The stars wheel slowly above. Everything is still.",
            "ja": "1ページ目と同じ木。裸の梢に星の光。小さな鳥が枝で眠っている。身を丸めて。安らぎ。星がゆっくりと頭上を巡る。すべてが静か。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}